##E-CID MEASUREMENT INITIATION REQUEST:ReportCharacteristics set to On-Demand,Measurement Quantity requested is SS-RSRP(6) and SS-RSRP(7)
# filter: nrppa.ReportCharacteristics == 0 and nrppa.measurementQuantitiesValue == 6 and nrppa.measurementQuantitiesValue == 7
